          "Serve gozo with sauce poured around and over it",
          "Eat with your right hand — pull off a piece of gozo, dip in sauce"
        ],
        "description": "The Central African Republic's essential meal — a smooth cassava dumpling dome served with a rich peanut-and-dried-fish sauce. The vigorous stirring technique and the communal eating style have caught attention from food creators exploring Central African cuisine.",
